{'symbol': 'TSN', 'date': '2023-05-11 16:17:00', 'title': 'TYSON FOODS ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SPRINGDALE, ARK., MAY 11, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TYSON FOODS (NYSE: TSN), AT A MEETING ON MAY 10, 2023, DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.48 PER SHARE ON CLASS A COMMON STOCK AND $0.432 PER SHARE ON CLASS B COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON SEPTEMBER 15, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPTEMBER 1, 2023.'}